<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4977" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμᾰρυγή</span></b>  [
			Att.
		
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῠ</span>, 
			Ep.
		<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῡ], ἡ,</span>
		<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sparkling, twinkling,
			glancing,</i> of objects in motion, as of the eye, <i><span class="en">
				<u>h.Merc.</u>
				45
			</span></i>; of stars, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.42
			</span></i>; of the sun, <i><span class="en">
				Procop.
				<u>Vand.</u>
				2.14
			</span></i>; of any quick motion, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἵππων ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Av.</u>
					925
				</span></i>
			:— also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρυγξ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γγος</span>, ἡ, Hdn.Gr.<i><span class="en">
				2.743
			</span></i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀμάρυξις</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">εως</span>, ἡ, Sch.<i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				3.1018
			</span></i>.</div>
